<title>HUNGARY: Hungary six-month T-bill yield drops to 22.47 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary six-month T-bill yield drops to 22.47 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on the latest issue of Hungary's six-month discount treasury bills was set by auction at 22.47 percent, down from 23.53 at an auction two weeks ago, the Government Debt Management Centre said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	    14,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received     45,585.28 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	   14,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		15,500 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    22.47 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		     89.9745 pct</p>
</text>
